From 156eeb9f0e7dd24d3de95c47d0e291d3356ace65 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yash <Yash.RameshbhaiSuthar@amd.com>
Date: Mon, 13 Apr 2026 16:29:01 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] SENSOR_LIB: Add multi-I2C bus support, MAX96716
 deserializer, and AE M17 backport

Add support for multiple I2C bus controllers, new MAX96716 deserializer,
and backport AE/AWB enhancements from M17 release for the 12-sensor
ISP firmware platform.

Multi-I2C Bus Support:
- Add AXI1/AXI2/AXI3 I2C instance definitions with base addresses
- Introduce core_des_mapping_t to centralize core-to-deserializer-to-I2C
  bus topology configuration
- Refactor HalI2c API to use i2cBusId instead of handles for init, deinit,
  read, and write operations
- Update readIIC/writeIIC function pointer signatures to use uint8_t buffers
- Add GetI2cBusIdForDes() and max9296_GetI2cBusIdForDes() lookup functions

MAX96716 Deserializer Driver:
- Add new max96716.h header with init tables for nDes1-nDes7
  and reverse splitter configuration
- Add max96716.c to build sources
- Add second FMC instance (g_fmc_second) for dual-FMC configurations

Serializer (MAX9295) Updates:
- Rework Ser0-Ser12 init register tables with corrected values
- Move AB_MODE/LEGACY_MODE conditional compilation from Ser2 to Ser4
- Populate Ser8/Ser9 init sequences
- Update MIPI lane mapping and PHY register settings
- Update deserializer default/alias addresses for new FMC board

AE M17 Backport (behind AE_M17_BACKPORT flag):
- Add IsiAWBModeSelection_t enum for ISP/sensor/combined WB gain control
- Add per-exposure integration time and gain range arrays
- Add ISI_INTEGRATION_TIME_QUANTIZE and ISI_EXP_NUM_MAX constants
- Add normGainSupport and normGain fields for normal gain mode

IMX623 Sensor Driver:
- Add sensor ID, min/max resolution, and exposure time range defines
- Add BLS mode/control, composite region, and manual black level registers
- Add digital gain min/max range defines
- Reorganize and document register map definitions

Build Configuration:
- Enable AE_M17_BACKPORT and ENABLE_I2C_GROUPING compile definitions
- Add SEC_TO_MICROSEC macro with include guard
- Add DUMMY_HAL_I2C_MODE sentinel to HalI2cMode enum
- Rename irStrength to irRangeInfo in IsiIrLightInfo_t
